B.adJ=s(["Press up and slightly in until your arms are straight.","Lower over two to three seconds to a deep stretch.","Keep your elbows under your wrists."],t.s)
B.a2A=new A.bS("Upper chest, shoulders","Bench at about 30 degrees. Dumbbells at your shoulders, palms forward.",B.adJ,"Arching hard to turn it back into a flat press.")
